This module deliberately exposes no cohort/bulk command.  ``run`` is callable
only after a future supervisor has selected one declared index and supplied an
exact binding manifest.  It preserves the legacy program's output as an
observation; it makes no primality, historical, curve-security, or ECDLP claim.
